# SEO

- Every route exports `metadata` with `title` (≤ 60 chars rendered) and `description` (≤ 160 chars).
- Every route sets `alternates.canonical` to its path.
- Structured data uses `next-seo` components or the local `<JsonLd>` server component — no hand-written `<meta>` tags in JSX.
- New routes must be added to `src/app/sitemap.ts`.
- JSON-LD claims must match visible page content.
